==Trivia==

===Historical origin===
Yukimura is based on the real-life {{wp|Sanada Yukimura}} of Japanese history, though as "Yukimura," he is generally an object of fiction. His real name is 真田信繁 ''Sanada Nobushige'' and in popular cases, he and [[Masakage]] tend to make up the "Yukimura" character. Also romanticized in legend are a group of ninja who served him, the {{wp|Sanada Ten Braves}}, seven of whom are in the game: [[Sasuke]], [[Saizō]], [[Jūzō]], [[Jinpachi]], [[Kamanosuke]], and brothers [[Isa]] and [[Seikai]].

[[Kei]] was his wife, [[Masayuki]] was his father, and [[Yukitaka]] was his grandfather.

